{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57595","headline":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 二 · 无名氏","name":"西王母授紫度炎光神变经颂三篇 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秀圃蔚神阶，朱扉琼林庭。\n流风鼓空洞，玉籁乘虚鸣。\n紫烟缠曲户，丹晖映绿軿。\n飞旗欝玄盖，羽节耀紫清。\n登景九霄际，遨游戏凤城。\n顾爱幽境子，一乐同朝生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}